name=Drive Recorder (dev tool)
id=DriveRecorderDev
description=Dev tool. Records how you drive: every 250 ms while you are in a driver's seat it writes the car's position, heading, speed, gas, brake, steering, engine speed, your health, the vehicles within 40 tiles and any knock to Zomboid/Lua/DriveRecorder_<time>.txt, one file per drive. Recording starts when you sit in the driver's seat and stops when you get out. F9 turns recording off and on. Needs no other mod. Singleplayer.
modversion=1.0.0
